{"sections":[{"slug":"自由-遗忘伴随","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"自由-遗忘伴随"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">自由</span>–<span lang=\"zh\">遗忘伴随</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">观念</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"自由–遗忘伴随"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"观念"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">自由</span>–<span lang=\"zh\">遗忘伴随形容的是如下的现象</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">两种数学结构</span> $A,B$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/语法–语义对偶","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">语法</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">之间有一态射</span> $A \\to B$, <span lang=\"zh\">使得</span> $B$-<span lang=\"zh\">结构总是可以</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">遗忘</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $A$-<span lang=\"zh\">结构</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">称之为</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">遗忘</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是因为常常</span> $A$-<span lang=\"zh\">结构是比较简单的结构</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">甚至是没有结构</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">但理论上不一定如此</span>); <span lang=\"zh\">进一步</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">遗忘函子有一左伴随</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">称之为</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">自由</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">函子</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">常常可以通过</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Kan扩张","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">左</span> Kan <span lang=\"zh\">扩张</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">构造</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这一现象发生在许多场合</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数上的模","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数上的模</span>"}},{"Plain":",</li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单子上的代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单子上的代数</span>"}},{"Plain":",</li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"/算畴上的代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">算畴上的代数</span>"}},{"Plain":" (<span lang=\"zh\">见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/oLKE","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">算畴左</span> Kan <span lang=\"zh\">扩张</span>"}},{"Plain":"),</li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代数理论","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数理论</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/语法–语义对偶","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">模型</span>"}},{"Plain":",</li>\n<li>…</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">这些场合是相互关联的</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">例如</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":" $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">给出单子</span> $-\\otimes A$, <span lang=\"zh\">其上的模即是该单子的代数</span>. "},{"Local":{"url":"/算畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">算畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">和</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代数理论","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数理论</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">也给出单子</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">若一对伴随能够表示为某个单子的自由</span>–<span lang=\"zh\">遗忘伴随</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则称之为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单子性函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单子性伴随</span>"}},{"Plain":" (monadic adjunction).</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">当某种集合或范畴上的结构的遗忘函子</span> $U\\colon \\mathcal C \\to \\mathsf{Set}$ (<span lang=\"zh\">或</span> $U\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathsf{Cat}$) "},{"Local":{"url":"/可表函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">余可表</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">时</span>,\n<span lang=\"zh\">它的余表示对象就是由一个元素</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">或一个对象</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">生成的自由结构</span> $F(1)$:\n$$\r\nU=\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Set}}(1,U-)=\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(F(1),-).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">且此时</span> $F(1)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的底层结构具有</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的结构</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/米田引理","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">米田引理</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的简单应用</span>:\n$$\r\nU(F(1)) = \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(F(1),F(1)) = \\operatorname{End}_{\\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal C,\\mathsf{Set})}(U).\r\n$$</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></strong>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">一个元素自由生成的幺半群</span> $(\\mathbb{N},+)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是遗忘函子</span> $U\\colon \\mathsf{Mon}\\to\\mathsf{Set}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的余表示对象</span>, $U(\\mathbb{N})=\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}(\\mathbb{N},\\mathbb{N})=\\operatorname{End}(U)\\simeq (\\mathbb{N},\\times)$.</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">一个元素自由生成的交换环</span> $\\mathbb{Z}[x]$ <span lang=\"zh\">是遗忘函子</span> $U\\colon \\mathsf{Ring} \\to \\mathsf{Set}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的余表示对象</span>, $U(\\mathbb{Z}[x]) = \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Ring}}(\\mathbb{Z}[x],\\mathbb{Z}[x]) = \\operatorname{End}(U)\\simeq (\\mathbb{Z}[x],\\circ)$.</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">更一般地</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">给定交换环</span> $A$, <span lang=\"zh\">一个元素自由生成的</span> $A$-<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span> $A[x]$ <span lang=\"zh\">是遗忘函子</span> $U\\colon \\mathsf{Alg}_A \\to \\mathsf{Set}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的余表示对象</span>, $U(A[x]) = \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Alg}_A}(A[x],A[x]) = \\operatorname{End}(U)$.</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">对于对称幺半范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$, <span lang=\"zh\">一个对象自由生成的</span> $\\mathcal C$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/充实范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">充实</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半范畴是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/对称序列","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称序列</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其上有一个幺半结构</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对应于自函子的复合</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">详见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/对称序列","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称序列</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}}]}